cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bohemian Wind, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bohemian Wind: from met mast data to a permitting pack"
abstract: >-
  Open-source software for wind project development: met mast data checks,
  long-term correction against NASA POWER, wind maps (a linear flow model, the
  Global Wind Atlas pattern, or CFD with OpenFOAM), turbine layout and energy
  with PyWake, noise and shadow-flicker screening, and permitting packs.
  Developer estimates only: not an accredited or bankable energy yield
  assessment.
authors:
  - name: "Bohemian Renewables (Africa)"
version: "0.3.1-dev"
date-released: "2026-11-21"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MugambiD/bohemian-wind"
url: "https://github.com/MugambiD/bohemian-wind"
keywords:
  - wind energy
  - wind resource assessment
  - met mast
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - energy yield
  - shadow flicker
  - Africa
